Subject: IR6 Conflict And Stale Review Expected Ledger
Date: 2026-05-26

@ [fixture_plan] docs/fixtures/IR6_Coordination_Mailbox_Fixture_Plan.v1.sop
@ [conflict_review_contract] docs/coordination/IR6_Conflict_Stale_And_Human_Override_Review_Contract.v1.sop
@ [activation_boundary] docs/implementation/IR6_Bounded_Coordination_Implementation_Activation_Boundary.v1.sop

& [ExpectedConflictAndStaleReviewLedger: IR6CoordinationMailbox] is the expected conflict, stale, and human override ledger
  + [conflict_review_envelope_required] is true
  + [stale_claim_review_envelope_required] is true
  + [human_override_review_envelope_required] is true
  + [completion_gate_interaction_required] is true
  + [required_field] is involved_claim_ref_set
  + [required_field] is evidence_ref_set
  + [required_field] is stale_trigger_ref_set
  + [required_field] is requested_override_scope
  + [required_field] is forbidden_effect_set
  + [required_field] is required_resolution

& [ExpectedConflictAndStaleReviewCaseSet: IR6CoordinationMailbox] is the per-fixture review ledger
  + [fixture_id] is conflicting_write_claims
    + [expected_review_state] is contested
    + [expected_downstream_gate_state] is blocked
  + [fixture_id] is stale_claim_refresh_required
    + [expected_review_state] is stale
    + [expected_resolution_set] is refresh_release_supersede_or_rebake
  + [fixture_id] is human_override_scope_review
    + [expected_review_state] is pending_review
    + [expected_forbidden_effect_set_visible] is true
  + [fixture_id] is hidden_scope_expansion_fault
    + [expected_review_state] is faulted
    + [expected_ready_state] is blocked
  + [fixture_id] is completion_gate_refusal_for_unresolved_claim
    + [expected_review_state] is unresolved
    + [expected_downstream_gate_state] is closed

  = must: block unresolved contested, stale, hidden expansion, ambiguous identity, and human override states
  = must: require completion review or rebake before downstream implementation gates open
